  "content": "这是由Shivaxi制作的适用于RLCraft的深色主题资源包，旨在迎合那些讨厌原版GUI的用户。它将大多数modpack的界面更改为灰色美学风格，并将持续更新至最新的RLCraft版本。<br><p>它支持：</p><ul><li>BoutifulBaubles</li><li>BetterNether</li><li>Charm</li><li>Classy Hats</li><li>Disenchanter</li><li>FirstAid</li><li>ForgottenItems</li><li>IceandFire</li><li>JEI</li><li>LevelUp2</li><li>QualityTools</li><li>Reskillable</li><li>Rustic</li><li>SpartanWeaponry</li><li>VariedCommodities</li><li>WearableBackPacks</li></ul><p>目前不兼容：</p><ul><li>TrinketsandBaubles</li></ul><p>额外支持：</p><ul><li>SimpleStorageNetwork</li></ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">画廊</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_09628242-5f20-47f8-9f73-dcc1f64ad0d3.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d8f6d63e-b6b3-422a-a765-0c9880044eec.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2bd4593d-f726-4393-8c79-10449c8c17c8.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0af645c1-246f-4f60-9761-3aba7dc6851d.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5adf894a-f1a5-4d4f-873a-1e5196fdf566.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cf86977b-22ea-45af-971f-c5cf2f787202.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_285fbce9-920b-4688-9909-b2fa6f4f27af.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ca7a42a0-2670-4226-bd4b-f8ff0ba4dffd.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5e2403fd-992e-4ff4-8c00-60d8023e3c42.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e73b1313-2507-4b72-a3a2-756b222f9267.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachmen